*.pdb

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
# Unity 工程的 Packages 目录下是依赖清单，必须提交（上面的 NuGet 规则会误伤）
!/[Pp]ackages/manifest.json
!/[Pp]ackages/packages-lock.json

# .NET build artifacts
artifacts/

# Publish output
publish/

